"video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "14177.png", "id": "3802550476541911", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828008_3802550479875244_5009659985664783095_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KixTjI3YBh4Q7kNvwGiNOVh&_nc_oc=AdqDZZQzuI9TdJsxHtLuqi0K5kP4CAM0LkdWEFgMG1C6IUUrsxLLBm_YToYCu2mXvYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXdH9tVP-JSajr7FUmfn2nQFVBYVA4DtC6UNpGYtlhfJA&oe=6B0F1D29"}, "display_name": "Stub-linVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Stub-linVR is a gorilla tag fan game I made so people can hang out with there friends, the game has loads of activities you can do such as buy cosmetics with the in-game currency (Stubs) and run around a forest jumping to tree to tree. +more.\n", "short_description": "Stub-linVR is a Gorilla Tag fan game where you hang out with friends, earn Stubs, buy cosmetics, and explore a forest full of movement and fun."}]}, "developer_name": "StubGamesStudio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/stub-linvr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "StubGamesStudio", "support_website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/stub-linvr/main", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/stub-linvr/main", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35270733979191575"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1225911982242468"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1225911982242468"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1775430000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1225911982242468"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "40822293980702186", "version": "2.5.5"}, "id": "1918434545734263", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "33366639516267707", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "40822293980702186"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1918434545734263"}]}, "change_log": "STUB-LINVR v2.5.5 \u2013 RELEASE NOTES\nChristmas Update \u2013 Patch 2\n\nThe Christmas update continues! Version 2.5.5 is here, bringing additional fixes, improvements and finishing touches to the festive experience.\n\nWhat's Changed?\n\nBug Fixes\n- Fixed several bugs discovered following the initial Christmas update.\n- Resolved issues with features that weren't updating correctly.\n- Fixed various minor issues affecting gameplay.\n\nImprovements\n- Updated previously missed Christmas content.\n- Additional adjustments to the winter environment.\n- General performance and stability improvements.\n- Further polish to the Christmas experience.\n\nDeveloper Notes\n\nThis update focuses on fixing issues and completing changes that were missed during the original v2.5.0 release.\n\nThank you to everyone who reported bugs and provided feedback. Your support helps us make Stub-linVR better with every update.\n\nHappy Holidays from StubGames Studio!\n\n\u2014 StubGames Studio", "created_date": 1795359797, "id": "40822293980702186", "version": "2.5.5", "version_code": 255, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "33366639516267707", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "40822293980702186"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1918434545734263"}]}, "change_log": "# STUB-LINVR \u2013 CHRISTMAS UPDATE\n### Official Release Notes\n\nThe Christmas update has arrived in Stub-linVR!\n\nWinter has finally taken over, bringing freezing temperatures, icy surroundings and festive decorations to the world of Stub-linVR. But it looks like Stubby has found himself in a bit of trouble...\n\n### What's New\n\n- **Christmas Map Makeover** \u2013 The world of Stub-linVR has received a festive winter transformation.\n- **Snow and Ice** \u2013 Experience the freezing new winter atmosphere.\n- **Christmas Decorations** \u2013 Festive decorations have appeared throughout the map.\n- **Stubby's Situation** \u2013 Stubby has gotten himself stuck in the ice. Can you find him?\n- **Seasonal Details** \u2013 Discover new Christmas-themed additions throughout the environment.\n\n### Improvements & Fixes\n- General map improvements.\n- Minor bug fixes and adjustments.\n- Overall seasonal polish.\n\n### A Message From StubGames Studio\n\nThank you to everyone who continues to support Stub-linVR. We've got plenty more planned, and we're excited to see what you think of this year's Christmas update.\n\nStay warm out there. It's getting icy!\n\n**\u2013 StubGames Studio**", "created_date": 1795209763, "id": "40783212577943660", "version": "2.5.0", "version_code": 25, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "33366639516267707", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "40822293980702186"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1918434545734263"}]}, "change_log": "\ufffd Stub-linVR \u2014 Halloween Update Release Notes\n\nHappy Halloween, Stubby's! \ufffd\ufffd\n\nThe Halloween update is here! We've brought some spooky changes to Stub-linVR to celebrate the season.\n\n\ufffd What's New?\n- \ufffd Halloween Forest \u2014 The forest has received a spooky Halloween makeover!\n- \ufffd Seasonal Atmosphere \u2014 Explore the forest with its Halloween-themed changes.\n- \ufffd Games Room Under Construction \u2014 The games room is currently being worked on. Please stay out while construction is ongoing!\n\n\ufffd Other Changes\n- \ufffd Behind-the-scenes improvements and update fixes.\n- \ufffd More changes and surprises may be on the way!\n\n\ufffd Important Notice\nPlease do not enter areas marked as under construction. These areas are not ready for players yet and may contain bugs.\n\nThank You!\nThank you for playing Stub-linVR and supporting StubGames Studio. We apologise for the delay caused by unexpected build issues, and we appreciate everyone's patience while we worked on getting the update ready.\n\nHave fun exploring, and happy Halloween! \ufffd\ufffd\n\n\u2014 StubGames Studio", "created_date": 1792257107, "id": "39872672768997650", "version": "2.4.5", "version_code": 245, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "33366639516267707", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "40822293980702186"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1918434545734263"}]}, "change_log": "\ufffd STUB-LINVR \u2014 UPDATE 2.3\nTHE HORROR EXPANSION\n\nThe horror gets worse.\n\nStub-linVR 2.3 is here, bringing an upgraded horror experience, a brand-new tree, and several annoying bugs finally fixed.\n\n\ufffd UPGRADED HORROR\n\nThe horror experience has been improved and upgraded.\n\nWe've made changes to make the horror side of Stub-linVR feel more intense, creepy, and polished.\n\nThis is only the beginning of what we have planned for the horror experience...\n\n\ufffd NEW TREE\n\nA brand-new tree has been added to Stub-linVR!\n\nA small addition, but one that helps bring more life and detail to the environment.\n\n\ufffd BUG FIXES\n\nWe've fixed several bugs in this update, including:\n\nFixed tree-related bugs\nFixed wall bugs\nImproved overall stability\nVarious small fixes and improvements\n\ufffd WHAT'S NEXT?\n\nWe're continuing to work on Stub-linVR and have more updates planned.\n\nThe horror is only getting started.\n\nThank you for playing and supporting Stub-linVR!\n\n\u2014 Mr Tay & the Stub-linVR Team\n\n\ufffd STUB-LINVR 2.3\n\nTHE HORROR CONTINUES.", "created_date": 1786472397, "id": "38183924491205828", "version": "2.3", "version_code": 23, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "33366639516267707", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "40822293980702186"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1918434545734263"}]}, "change_log": "Wall Bug Fixed", "created_date": 1786318206, "id": "38141768382088106", "version": "2.2.5", "version_code": 225, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}